# Spectroscopic activity of the Gamma-point phonons (IR / Raman / silent / acoustic),
# Raman tensors, the Wyckoff-orbit breakdown, and the dielectric response from BORN
# testsuite section 29; the inputs are those of ../28_phonon_irrep,
# ../30_phonon_fatband/ScF3_Pm-3m and ../test_POSCARs (nothing is copied here;
# crystod-example 29 also copies 28_phonon_irrep and 30_phonon_fatband)
#
# Every cd below and every -c ../test_POSCARs/... path is relative to this
# directory (29_phonon_activity): go back here (cd -) before the next one.
#
# A Gamma mode is IR active when its irrep occurs in the vector representation
# of the point group, Raman active when it occurs in the symmetric square of the
# vector representation, silent when neither. The rigid translations (the
# acoustic set) are reported as acoustic, not as IR active.
# Counterpart of the selection-rule table of Bilbao SAM
# (https://www.cryst.ehu.es/rep/sam.html).

# 1. From force constants: crystod-phonon --irreps adds an activity line to every
#    degenerate set at GM, an activity_summary line to the GM block and a
#    "nac:" header line to phonon_irreps.yaml (run where FORCE_SETS is); every
#    GM set also gets a mulliken line (the Mulliken symbol from phonopy's
#    character tables), which the terminal summary shows in square brackets

$ cd ../28_phonon_irrep/SrTiO3_Pm-3m
$ crystod-phonon --irreps --dim 4 4 4 -c 221_PPOSCAR_SrTiO3

* Gamma-point activity *
GM4- [T1u] x4 (3 IR, 1 acoustic)
GM5- [T2u] x1 (silent)

* Band path *
  k path (seekpath): GM-X-M-GM-R-X | R-M  (306 q points)
  Labeled points: X, GM, R, M

* Output files *
  Phonon irreps written to: phonon_irreps.yaml
  Phonon dispersion with irrep labels written to: phonon_irreps.pdf

phonon_irreps.yaml (header and GM block):

space_group: Pm-3m
nac: false
...
- q_label: GM
  q_position: [0.0, 0.0, 0.0]
  activity_summary: GM4- x4 (3 IR, 1 acoustic), GM5- x1 (silent)
  band_sets:
  - band_indices: [1, 2, 3]
    irrep_label: ['GM4-(3)']
    mulliken: T1u
    frequency:   0.0000003685
    activity: [acoustic]
  - band_indices: [4, 5, 6]
    irrep_label: ['GM4-(3)']
    mulliken: T1u
    frequency:   2.6629186664
    activity: [IR]
  - band_indices: [7, 8, 9]
    irrep_label: ['GM4-(3)']
    mulliken: T1u
    frequency:   4.7144147359
    activity: [IR]
  - band_indices: [10, 11, 12]
    irrep_label: ['GM5-(3)']
    mulliken: T2u
    frequency:   7.3464877515
    activity: [silent]
  - band_indices: [13, 14, 15]
    irrep_label: ['GM4-(3)']
    mulliken: T1u
    frequency:  15.3054117938
    activity: [IR]

# m-3m: GM4- = T1u (IR), GM5- = T2u (silent); no Raman-active mode in cubic
# perovskite SrTiO3.

$ cd ../28_phonon_irrep/Si_Fd-3m
